📧 Email Spam Classification using Machine Learning

An automated Natural Language Processing (NLP) pipeline built using Scikit-Learn to classify email and SMS messages into **Spam** or **Ham (Legitimate)**.

📌 Project Overview
* **Domain**: Machine Learning / NLP
* **Dataset**: SMS/Email Spam Collection Dataset (Kaggle)
* **Model**: Multinomial Naive Bayes
* **Feature Extraction**: TF-IDF Vectorizer (Term Frequency-Inverse Document Frequency)

 📊 Performance Metrics
| Metric | Score |
| :--- | :--- |
| **Accuracy** | 98.0% |
| **Precision** | 97.5% |
| **Recall** | 91.0% |
| **F1-Score** | 94.0% |

